WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
ALEGRETE SUMMIT 2026 presents

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.200
AI: data · models · algorithms
INNOVATION: people · ideas · territory

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.200
AI without innovation loses its meaning.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.300
Innovation without AI loses its speed.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
AI + INNOVATION
the inseparable symbiosis

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
neither moves forward without the other

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.000
AI serving those who produce, care, teach, govern and do business.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Every sector of the Pampa, a new connection.
(Rice and water · Livestock · Energy · Health · Education · Public management · Trade and services · Border logistics)

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.600
the innovation cycle with AI
Data → Models → Decisions → People → New problems

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.200
AI learns from data.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.800
Innovation learns from people.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.000
Human oversight in every turn.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.000
Public sector · Companies · Academia · Society
Innovating is building bridges.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
AI is the new bridge.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:07.000
AI + INNOVATION
an inseparable and necessary symbiosis

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.000
ALEGRETE SUMMIT 2026 · October 29–30, 2026 · Sicredi Essência · Alegrete, Brazil
Innovating is building bridges.
